      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "void\nPoint3d::\noperator+=( const Point3d &rhs )\n{\n_x += rhs._x;\n_y += rhs._y;\n_z += rhs._z;\n};\n\n// Pseudo C++ Code\n__vbcPoint2d->_x += rhs.__vbcPoint2d->_x;\n__vbcPoint2d->_y += rhs.__vbcPoint2d->_y;\n_z += rhs._z;\n\nPoint2d *p2d = pv3d;\n// Pseudo C++ code\nVPoint2d *p2d = pv3d ? pv3d->__vbcPoint2d : 0;",
      "fontSize": 19.888888888888886,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "void\nPoint3d::\noperator+=( const Point3d &rhs )\n{\n_x += rhs._x;\n_y += rhs._y;\n_z += rhs._z;\n};\n\n// Pseudo C++ Code\n__vbcPoint2d->_x += rhs.__vbcPoint2d->_x;\n__vbcPoint2d->_y += rhs.__vbcPoint2d->_y;\n_z += rhs._z;\n\nPoint2d *p2d = pv3d;\n// Pseudo C++ code\nVPoint2d *p2d = pv3d ? pv3d->__vbcPoint2d : 0;",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fV92284qyEJ3dUQIi5k6A",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1428.5674603174607,
      "y": 3843.400793650793,
      "width": 200.19992065429688,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "z0RWULOWfdgoyUkoZAGuF",
      "index": "Zzzzzzzzzzzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1202020633,
      "version": 1194,
      "versionNonce": 981592023,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777356556368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "shared region",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "shared region",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VVPUMr9YfDReXVsGfEd73",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1253.2896825396829,
      "y": 4022.4285714285706,
      "width": 771.2994995117188,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "z0RWULOWfdgoyUkoZAGuF",
      "index": "ZzzzzzzzzzzzV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1733773335,
      "version": 1138,
      "versionNonce": 349332761,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777356556368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The shared region represents the virtual base class subobjects. \nThe location of data within the shared region fluctuates with each derivation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The shared region represents the virtual base class subobjects. \nThe location of data within the shared region fluctuates with each derivation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GG-tM1gaBcobtD5Gw2AGw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1255.9285714285716,
      "y": 3966.31746031746,
      "width": 996.6593017578125,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "z0RWULOWfdgoyUkoZAGuF",
      "index": "Zzzzzzzzzzzzl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1390763449,
      "version": 1085,
      "versionNonce": 674485337,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777356679679,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Data within the invariant region remains at a fixed offset from the start of the object\nregardless of subsequent derivations. So members within the invariant region can be accessed directly.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Data within the invariant region remains at a fixed offset from the start of the object\nregardless of subsequent derivations. So members within the invariant region can be accessed directly.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nS2s8CDq7NvRnIb9CkZmL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 447.08328755696675,
      "y": 2974.4286248343324,
      "width": 672.4395141601562,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "z0RWULOWfdgoyUkoZAGuF",
      "index": "Zzzzzzzzzzzzt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 426101751,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 123230713,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777356556368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A semantic side effect of multiple inheritance is the need to support\n a form of shared subobject inheritance.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A semantic side effect of multiple inheritance is the need to support\n a form of shared subobject inheritance.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "3plICRpTCU9UFk65-D6Y6",
      "type": "arrow",
      "x": 1023.0054408482142,
      "y": 3069.406208084822,
      "width": 82.82784670875253,
      "height": 2.5224167495102847,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "z0RWULOWfdgoyUkoZAGuF",
      "index": "Zzzzzzzzzzzzx",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 2
      },
      "seed": 674898839,
      "version": 35,
      "versionNonce": 2087525911,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777356556368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "points": [
        [
          0,
          0
