      "updated": 1777343616476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The assignment of the derived class object to a pointer or reference to the base class\n (regardless of the depth of the inheritance hierarchy) requires no compiler intervention\n or modification of the address. Instead, it happens \"naturally,\" and in that sense, it\nprovides optimal runtime efficiency.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The assignment of the derived class object to a pointer or reference to the base class\n (regardless of the depth of the inheritance hierarchy) requires no compiler intervention\n or modification of the address. Instead, it happens \"naturally,\" and in that sense, it\nprovides optimal runtime efficiency.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jAdYOTjJ77tV4TjyQX9-F",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1270.8332875569668,
      "y": 1895.6785866873597,
      "width": 928.7593994140625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "Y0izHyeFTvcYX8bpjdu-G",
      "index": "b6Pt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 741509079,
      "version": 307,
      "versionNonce": 1772780729,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777343616476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "that placing the vptr at the beginning of the class object breaks the natural polymorphism of\n single inheritance in the special case of a base class without virtual functions and a derived\n class with them.\nThe conversion of the derived object to the base in this case requires the intervention of the\n compiler in order to adjust the address being assigned by the size of the vptr.\nThe complexity of multiple inheritance lies in the \"unnatural\" relationship of the derived class \nwith its second and subsequent base class subobjects.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "that placing the vptr at the beginning of the class object breaks the natural polymorphism of\n single inheritance in the special case of a base class without virtual functions and a derived\n class with them.\nThe conversion of the derived object to the base in this case requires the intervention of the\n compiler in order to adjust the address being assigned by the size of the vptr.\nThe complexity of multiple inheritance lies in the \"unnatural\" relationship of the derived class \nwith its second and subsequent base class subobjects.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aIClxP81TQkg_0vj-6kE9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1887.0832875569668,
      "y": 2068.1785866873597,
      "width": 352,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "Y0izHyeFTvcYX8bpjdu-G",
      "index": "b6Px",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 736779223,
      "version": 590,
      "versionNonce": 221623479,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777346462699,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "class Point2d {\npublic:\n// ...virtual function\nprotected:\nfloat _x, _y;\n};\nclass Point3d : public Point2d {\npublic:\n//...no virtual function\nprotected:\nfloat _z;\n};\nclass Vertex {\npublic:\n// ...virtual function\nprotected:\nVertex *next;\n};\nclass Vertex3d :\npublic Point3d, public Vertex {\npublic:\n//...no virtual function\nprotected:\nfloat mumble;\n};",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "class Point2d {\npublic:\n// ...virtual function\nprotected:\nfloat _x, _y;\n};\nclass Point3d : public Point2d {\npublic:\n//...no virtual function\nprotected:\nfloat _z;\n};\nclass Vertex {\npublic:\n// ...virtual function\nprotected:\nVertex *next;\n};\nclass Vertex3d :\npublic Point3d, public Vertex {\npublic:\n//...no virtual function\nprotected:\nfloat mumble;\n};",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "xXMOiVt_agZpzeVOUE6YI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1637.0832875569668,
      "y": 2720.6785866873597,
      "width": 594,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "Y0izHyeFTvcYX8bpjdu-G",
      "index": "b6Pzl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2054254489,
      "version": 613,
      "versionNonce": 941132409,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777346528576,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "extern void mumble( const Vertex& );\nVertex3d v;\n...\n// conversion of a Vertex3d to Vertex is ``unnatural''\nmumble( v );",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "extern void mumble( const Vertex& );\nVertex3d v;\n...\n// conversion of a Vertex3d to Vertex is ``unnatural''\nmumble( v );",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
